{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39726","headline":"南海幕和段先辈送韦侍御赴阙 · 黄滔","name":"南海幕和段先辈送韦侍御赴阙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"树色川光入暮秋，使车西发不胜愁。\n璧连标格惊分散，雪课篇章互唱酬。\n魏阙别当飞羽翼，燕台独且占风流。\n满园歌管凉宵月，此後相思几上楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39726.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39726","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}